{%- comment -%}
  ORGATEC 2026 landing page — one self-contained section.
  Campaign: MONTEIRO_GG_LEADS_ORGATEC_09-26 (Google Ads, DACH).
  Bilingual by locale (DE / EN fallback), own CSS, native contact form
  for stand meetings, .ics download, Event JSON-LD, pre/live/post phase.
  Copy for the collection cards is transcribed from the stand panels (09/2026).
{%- endcomment -%}

